        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1765032624886706,
        "y0": 0.5843307911747634,
        "x1": 0.8873407825145846,
        "y1": 0.5982701850659919
      },
      "text": "(3) The Vice-President shall not enter upon the duties of his or her office unless he or she",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768627790064594,
        "y0": 0.6003913987766613,
        "x1": 0.8873841778125638,
        "y1": 0.6143307926678898
      },
      "text": "has taken and subscribed the oath of allegiance and such oath for the due execution of his or her",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768627790064594,
        "y0": 0.6163004973922113,
        "x1": 0.4572564418019812,
        "y1": 0.6302398912834399
      },
      "text": "office as may be prescribed by Parliament.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1765032624886706,
        "y0": 0.6323611049941091,
        "x1": 0.8728302725000319,
        "y1": 0.6463004988853378
      },
      "text": "(4) If the Vice-President is absent from Botswana or is incapable by reason of illness or",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768627790064594,
        "y0": 0.6482702036096593,
        "x1": 0.8562540540508196,
        "y1": 0.6622095975008877
      },
      "text": "any other cause of discharging the functions of his or her office, the President may appoint a",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768627790064594,
        "y0": 0.6641793022252093,
        "x1": 0.8429169748343673,
        "y1": 0.6781186961164378
      },
      "text": "person, from among the Members of the Assembly, to perform the functions of the office of",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768627790064594,
        "y0": 0.6802398905609593,
        "x1": 0.8199301576302722,
        "y1": 0.6941792844521879
      },
      "text": "Vice-President and any person so appointed may discharge those functions accordingly:",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1765032624886706,
        "y0": 0.6961489891765094,
        "x1": 0.8331010731217129,
        "y1": 0.7100883830677379
      },
      "text": "Provided that a person appointed under this subsection shall cease to perform the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768627790064594,
        "y0": 0.7122095967784072,
        "x1": 0.4356966205671722,
        "y1": 0.7261489906696358
      },
      "text": "functions of the office of Vice-President-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14807843227012485,
        "y0": 0.7281186953939573,
        "x1": 0.16406117856892105,
        "y1": 0.7420580892851858
      },
      "text": "(i)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.18807189293157042,
        "y0": 0.7281186953939573,
        "x1": 0.6075377495460261,
        "y1": 0.7420580892851858
      },
      "text": "if his or her appointment is revoked by the President;",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.143960778230156,
        "y0": 0.7441792837297074,
        "x1": 0.16385803970636106,
        "y1": 0.7581186776209359
      },
      "text": "(ii)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.18807189293157042,
        "y0": 0.7441792837297074,
        "x1": 0.8485596974690756,
        "y1": 0.7581186776209359
      },
      "text": "if he or she ceases to be a Member of the Assembly otherwise than by reason of a",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.18807189293157042,
        "y0": 0.7601262595918443,
        "x1": 0.3889025021222682,
        "y1": 0.7740656534830729
      },
      "text": "dissolution of Parliament;",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14003921957576976,
        "y0": 0.7760353582073944,
        "x1": 0.16385098376305274,
        "y1": 0.7899747520986229
      },
      "text": "(iii)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.18807189293157042,
        "y0": 0.7760353582073944,
        "x1": 0.6976287318210975,
        "y1": 0.7899747520986229
      },
      "text": "upon the assumption by any person of the office of President; or",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.13905881744584228,
        "y0": 0.7920959658092923,
        "x1": 0.16386273951312297,
        "y1": 0.8060353597005209
      },
      "text": "(iv)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.18807189293157042,
        "y0": 0.7920959658092923,
        "x1": 0.8874344046598945,
        "y1": 0.8060353597005209
      },
      "text": "upon the President giving him or her notice that the Vice-President is about to resume his",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.18807189293157042,
        "y0": 0.8080050451586944,
        "x1": 0.3169620987636591,
        "y1": 0.8219444390499231
      },
      "text": "or her functions.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1765032624886706,
        "y0": 0.8240656527605924,
        "x1": 0.8469700158811083,
        "y1": 0.838005046651821
      },
      "text": "(5) Where the Vice-President is performing the functions of the office of President in",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768627790064594,
        "y0": 0.8399747513761424,
        "x1": 0.8872275009653927,
        "y1": 0.853914145267371
      },
      "text": "accordance with section 35 or 36 of this Constitution he or she may appoint a person, from among",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768627790064594,
        "y0": 0.8558838403586185,
        "x1": 0.8682556401670368,
        "y1": 0.8698232342498471
      },
      "text": "the Members of the Assembly, to perform the functions of the office of Vice-President and any",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768627790064594,
        "y0": 0.8719393905967173,
        "x1": 0.6291701622258604,
        "y1": 0.8858787844879459
      },
      "text": "person so appointed may discharge those functions accordingly:",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11768627790064594,
        "y0": 0.9369393948352698,
        "x1": 0.4252188688789318,
